# Two runs in one session, for tools/check_run_sequence.ps1.
#
# Geant4 gives two different answers here and the same pair every time the program starts.
# Both halves are checked: that the second run is a different sample, and that a fresh process
# replays the pair. run_sequence_one.mac runs 40000 in one go, which must equal these two
# summed - the sharp form of "the random stream carries on".
/run/initialize
/run/beamOn 20000
/run/beamOn 20000
